Maintainer: He Li <he.li.math@outlook.com>
Description: Implements two-stage methods for the analysis of longitudinal
    omics data. Stage 1 applies Principal Component Analysis (PCA) to
    high-dimensional metabolomics (or other omics) measurements collected
    repeatedly over time. Stage 2 models the estimated PC scores using either
    a Linear Mixed Model (LMM) with a subject-specific random intercept over
    visit, or Functional Data Analysis (FDA) for smooth age-indexed
    trajectories. The package provides estimation, inference for visit effects,
    age-trajectory prediction, important-feature ranking, simulated example
    data, and downstream visualization utilities.
